# Old domain -> new domain, path-preserving (grace window until at least Jan 2028)
https://jkfm.co/* https://jkfacilitiesmanagement.com.au/:splat 301!
http://jkfm.co/* https://jkfacilitiesmanagement.com.au/:splat 301!
https://www.jkfm.co/* https://jkfacilitiesmanagement.com.au/:splat 301!
http://www.jkfm.co/* https://jkfacilitiesmanagement.com.au/:splat 301!
# Canonical host: www -> apex on the new domain
https://www.jkfacilitiesmanagement.com.au/* https://jkfacilitiesmanagement.com.au/:splat 301!
# Duplicate-URL cleanup: collapse index.html variants onto the canonical paths
/index.html / 301!
/blog/index.html /blog/ 301!
# Internal folders: the repo root is published, so these are uploaded with every deploy. Return 404 so they are not reachable on the site.
/docs /404.html 404!
/docs/* /404.html 404!
/uniform-mockup /404.html 404!
/uniform-mockup/* /404.html 404!
